{"l": 0, "i": 25, "text": "user: Alex on agent topology: this chat is the long-lived general FNI project channel; multiple short-lived Hermes agents work on aspects while Alex is at the keyboard; GhstClwd is a disconnected OpenClaw used for general chat and to vet Hermes's responses. Alex endorsed adopting the OptChat/OptMem memory pattern for the project.", "size": 331}
